# The map cells are binary and now tracked (they used to be gitignored while
# the map was borrowed). core.autocrlf is on for this checkout, and git's
# binary detection is a heuristic over the first 8000 bytes -- these files
# would almost certainly be detected correctly, but a lotpack silently
# rewritten by line-ending conversion is close to undiagnosable, so say it.
*.lotpack  binary
*.lotheader binary
*.bin      binary
*.pack     binary
*.tiles    binary
*.xcf      binary
